  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deaf children&apos;s access to quality education in Kilimanjaro Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Signal and Childreach Tanzania have worked together, in Tanzania, since 2009. Signal has expertise in community based support for deaf adults and children. Childreach Tanzania has expertise in school improvement with strong links in the Ministry of Education. In the past 3 years, Childreach Tanzania has been developing its work to support Hearing Impaired/Deaf children. This proposal will allow both organisations to measure how many deaf children are in/out of primary school in the Kilimanjaro region. It will consult with parents, communities, teachers and government workers to better understand the barriers to schooling and work to identify opportunities for future joint programming.</narrative>
  </description>
